{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>A thousand per tribe, a thousand per tribe</b> — for every tribe two thousand, behold 24 thousand went against them to war, corresponding to the 24 thousand who fell of Israel. The verse begins with alef and ends with alef, to tell you that all of them had one heart to their Father in heaven."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:23:26.651836111Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}